{%- comment -%}
MIM page content (v3.9.8). Content still comes from the page body in admin (and its FR/NL/AR translations).
- FAQ pages (handle "faqs", or a body with the old .tt-box-faq markup): the body is split into questions (h6 / .tt-title
  headings) and shown as animated accordions, with a live search box, quick facts (shipping, free delivery, exchanges, payment)
  and a WhatsApp help card at the end.
- Other pages (Techniques, Team, How to measure…): blocks fade up as they scroll in, photos zoom gently on hover, and pages with
  3+ headings get a sticky "chapter" chip bar that follows the reading position.
No extra requests: CSS and JS are inline and only on pages using this section. Motion is off for prefers-reduced-motion.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if page != blank and page.handle == 'how-to-measure' -%}
{% render 'mim-size-guide' %}
{%- elsif page != blank and page.handle != section.settings.skip_handle -%}
{%- liquid
  assign is_faq = false
  if page.handle == 'faqs' or page.content contains 'tt-box-faq'
    assign is_faq = true
